{"suttaId":"tha-ap201","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[7378,7396],"vripara":"47"},"segments":{"tha-ap201:0.3":"Kiṃkaṇikapupphiyattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap201:1.1":"“Sumaṅgaloti nāmena, sayambhū aparājito;","tha-ap201:1.3":"Pavanā nikkhamitvāna, nagaraṃ pāvisī jino.","tha-ap201:2.1":"“Piṇḍacāraṃ caritvāna, nikkhamma nagarā muni;","tha-ap201:2.3":"Katakiccova sambuddho, so vasī vanamantare.","tha-ap201:3.1":"“Kiṃkaṇipupphaṃ paggayha, buddhassa abhiropayiṃ;","tha-ap201:3.3":"Pasannacitto sumano, sayambhussa mahesino.","tha-ap201:4.1":"“Catunnavutito kappe, yaṃ pupphamabhiropayiṃ;","tha-ap201:4.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, buddhapūjāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap201:5.1":"“Chaḷāsītimhito kappe, apilāsisanāmako;","tha-ap201:5.3":"Sattaratanasampanno, cakkavattī mahabbalo.","tha-ap201:6.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap201:7.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā kiṃkaṇikapupphiyo thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap201:8.1":"Kiṃkaṇikapupphiyattherassāpadānaṃ navamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
